01:31.040 --> 01:34.180
​​​ ​By chance, deer days​ ​​

01:34.180 --> 01:36.350
​​​ ​Hatenkou bacchikamon​ ​​

01:34.180 --> 01:36.350
​​​ ​Extraordinarily unpredictable​ ​​

