01:56.050 --> 02:01.020
Enrollment hiccup

02:06.400 --> 02:08.780
W-w-why is there a deer in the room!?

02:08.790 --> 02:12.540
Deer Club
Seeking new members!

02:09.100 --> 02:12.530
Well, it's inevitable for there to be deer in the Deer Club.

02:17.230 --> 02:20.290
Actually, they've been around pretty normally until now.

02:20.420 --> 02:22.320
Why didn't I notice?

02:32.730 --> 02:35.480
Hey, don't eat the club's deer crackers without permission!

02:35.820 --> 02:38.530
Hey, Shikanoko! Did you bring it here?

02:40.080 --> 02:40.810
Not here?

02:48.370 --> 02:49.570
Could it be this deer!

02:55.220 --> 02:56.180
Shikanoko!

02:56.530 --> 02:57.730
Stop messing around!

02:58.010 --> 03:00.510
I already know you're Shikanoko!

03:00.850 --> 03:02.200
Change back quickly!

03:06.030 --> 03:07.090
Not changing back?

03:08.020 --> 03:11.280
Ah, you're teasing me, huh?

03:11.570 --> 03:13.070
You've got some nerve.

03:13.230 --> 03:16.740
I'll tear off that deer disguise for you!

03:17.400 --> 03:17.910
Good!

03:18.490 --> 03:21.080
Take it off! Take off that costume!

03:21.230 --> 03:25.610
Did you really think I wouldn't notice you wearing that?

03:42.660 --> 03:45.220
Aaah, I'm so thirsty.

03:46.020 --> 03:50.310
I went back and forth between the clubroom and the school building.

03:52.150 --> 03:55.920
Oh, by the way, I got something good earlier.

03:57.230 --> 04:02.130
Ta-da! Limited edition! Super popular at Hinominami High School!

04:02.270 --> 04:05.360
Sakura Mochi-flavored Tapioca Milk Tea!

04:05.850 --> 04:08.160
You can't drink it while still a deer.

04:08.390 --> 04:10.020
Too bad, huh.

04:10.220 --> 04:12.840
It's my treat, too.

04:14.550 --> 04:17.750
If you can't drink it, I'll have to drink it for you.

04:17.860 --> 04:18.720
Is that okay?

04:18.870 --> 04:21.180
I'll drink it all for you.

04:21.480 --> 04:22.290
Ignored!

04:22.930 --> 04:25.750
Damn, not even tapioca fazes you.

04:31.230 --> 04:32.570
Manjiro!

04:33.100 --> 04:34.730
Deer are herbivores.

04:35.060 --> 04:36.440
They eat grass and leaves.

04:37.170 --> 04:41.100
The Manjiro I've painstakingly nurtured…

04:41.890 --> 04:47.490
Koshi-tan named and carefully raised all the Deer Club's houseplants.

04:44.320 --> 04:47.820
Iruka

04:44.320 --> 04:47.820
Umako

04:44.320 --> 04:47.820
Ezo

04:48.120 --> 04:50.050
Don't nibble on them, you dumb deer!

04:53.050 --> 04:55.110
Whoa, what's that noise?

04:55.380 --> 04:56.550
First time hearing it.

04:57.610 --> 05:01.480
When male deer become aggressive, they make a "gegege" sound to intimidate.

05:01.690 --> 05:03.910
At this time, you mustn't approach recklessly.

05:04.640 --> 05:06.280
Stubborn, huh.

05:06.800 --> 05:08.460
But I can't back down either.

05:08.880 --> 05:11.240
I must protect the Manjiro's life…

05:11.970 --> 05:13.830
If it comes to this, I'll use force!

05:15.360 --> 05:18.470
Your weakness, take that, a plastic bottle!

05:19.010 --> 05:22.700
Nokotan is afraid of bottles filled with water.

05:27.660 --> 05:29.740
How's that, can't do anything now, huh?

05:30.250 --> 05:34.720
If you want it moved, change back to your original form now.

05:36.260 --> 05:37.610
Huh?

05:38.800 --> 05:42.040
When did you overcome your fear of plastic bottles?

05:44.300 --> 05:49.470
I need to find something more fundamentally interesting to Shikanoko to protect the Manjiro.

05:50.060 --> 05:52.900
Something that might catch Shikanoko's interest.

05:59.910 --> 06:01.930
Th-this is it!

06:05.970 --> 06:10.840
Oh no, my embarrassing poetry notebook is here!

06:11.260 --> 06:14.800
I have to burn this humiliating thing right away.

06:15.170 --> 06:15.780
<i>Glance.</i>

06:16.380 --> 06:19.300
Well, since it's you, Shikanoko…

06:19.600 --> 06:26.630
If you change back to your original form, I'll let you see it before I burn it.

06:27.610 --> 06:35.050
This poem notebook, which is too embarrassing to leave at home, I carry with me everywhere.

06:35.620 --> 06:38.420
But if I go this far, she'll…

06:39.830 --> 06:42.930
Bingo! She reacted! Just one more push!

06:44.840 --> 06:51.460
I could also let you hear my newly written original song…

06:51.650 --> 06:53.700
What's that? I want to hear it!

06:53.950 --> 06:56.600
Alright, just a little then.

06:57.470 --> 06:59.460
One, two, three, four.

06:59.960 --> 07:04.060
Zuzunzunchacha, zuzunzunchacha.

07:04.370 --> 07:07.630
Go, ex-delinquent Koshi-tan

07:07.880 --> 07:14.540
Can you hear the sad wind, is someone crying, woowoowoo

07:15.130 --> 07:17.800
Behind the school building after hours

07:18.160 --> 07:22.350
The hungry tiger's territory, an untouchable sanctuary

07:22.730 --> 07:25.360
Touch carelessly and you'll get bitten…

07:25.630 --> 07:31.630
But I can't leave you alone, I'll wipe away your sad song, your tears…

07:32.130 --> 07:35.770
Yare yare, I just don't want to stand out.

07:36.460 --> 07:37.400
Three minutes?

07:38.330 --> 07:40.380
Haa, three seconds is enough.

07:41.170 --> 07:43.330
Go fight, Koshi-tan!

07:43.670 --> 07:46.920
I might be an ex-delinquent, but don't underestimate me, street gang

07:47.250 --> 07:51.480
The fierce tiger's fist will crush your cheekbones and spit fire

07:52.290 --> 07:54.590
The tiger's paws aren't soft.

07:59.950 --> 08:03.540
Call me when you want to cry, Koshi-tan! Koshi-tan!

08:05.600 --> 08:09.250
I'm the ex-delinquent Koshi-tan!

08:09.520 --> 08:11.780
Now for the second verse!

08:17.640 --> 08:21.400
Zunzunchacha, zunzunchacha

08:21.830 --> 08:25.450
Go, ex-delinquent Koshi-tan

08:26.570 --> 08:31.140
Oops, I can't let you hear any more.

08:31.570 --> 08:33.410
Huh? Too bad.

08:33.530 --> 08:36.670
No way, you need to return to your original form.

08:38.570 --> 08:40.450
I want to hear more!

08:42.270 --> 08:44.580
Ex-delinquent Koshi-tan, sing it!

08:46.650 --> 08:49.480
Deer Club
Seeking new members!

08:47.080 --> 08:49.380
Gyyaaa!

08:51.610 --> 08:53.410
Ah, Shikanoko?

08:53.150 --> 09:00.950
Deer crackers

08:54.240 --> 08:56.430
Two Shikanokos. Wh-what's going on?

08:57.830 --> 08:58.870
Two of me?

08:59.180 --> 09:00.750
What are you talking about, Koshi-tan?

09:00.850 --> 09:02.580
But, but!

09:02.750 --> 09:06.290
Nun. Nun. Nununun?

09:07.150 --> 09:08.110
Having a conversation?

09:08.700 --> 09:11.690
It seems it escaped from Hino Zoo.

09:12.210 --> 09:13.440
I-is that so?

09:13.550 --> 09:18.050
Deer crackers

09:13.790 --> 09:16.500
Maybe it was attracted by the smell of deer crackers?

09:16.580 --> 09:18.190
What's with that!

09:19.290 --> 09:21.790
More importantly, what's this poem notebook?

09:23.220 --> 09:26.490
Ah, the original song from earlier.

09:26.850 --> 09:28.630
Hey, hey, sing the rest.

09:28.970 --> 09:31.920
Go, ex-delinquent Koshi-tan

09:33.560 --> 09:38.320
Koshi-tan wanted nothing more than to crawl into a hole.

09:41.520 --> 09:43.120
You had busy day.

09:44.890 --> 09:48.340
The deer went back to Hino Zoo.

09:48.540 --> 09:52.050
Mt. Kinka
Koganeyama Shrine

09:52.050 --> 09:55.550
Mt. Kinka
Sanriku Fukkō National Park

09:57.300 --> 10:01.600
Entance ceremony

09:57.730 --> 10:03.300
Under the warm sunlight, the cherry blossoms were in full bloom.

10:04.110 --> 10:08.210
Congratulations to all new students on your enrollment.

10:09.060 --> 10:13.440
On behalf of the students, I offer my heartfelt congratulations.

10:14.080 --> 10:14.910
Spring.

10:15.260 --> 10:17.810
Koshi-tan and the others advanced to their third year.

10:18.550 --> 10:21.370
Apparently, it wasn't Sazae-san time.

10:21.900 --> 10:24.990
I wanted to see Koshi-tan's student council president speech.

10:25.250 --> 10:27.070
It must've been cool.

10:27.700 --> 10:29.650
Hmph, of course.

10:34.880 --> 10:37.040
Eh? No way!? Are you okay!?

10:37.220 --> 10:38.400
Why are you here?

10:38.790 --> 10:40.240
What happened? Are you feeling unwell?

10:40.560 --> 10:42.100
Shall I take you to the infirmary?

10:42.290 --> 10:43.800
Or call an ambulance?

10:43.930 --> 10:45.130
No, the police!?

10:45.340 --> 10:46.560
Self-Defense Forces?

10:59.360 --> 11:03.620
Bashame was so excited so fell asleep.

11:03.920 --> 11:05.600
S-so that's it.

11:06.010 --> 11:06.600
Bashame?

11:07.170 --> 11:09.460
I'm glad you're not unwell.

11:09.600 --> 11:11.420
But why are you here?

11:11.820 --> 11:14.200
You look like a new student.

11:14.670 --> 11:17.220
Bashame came to see you.

11:18.170 --> 11:22.390
Bashame Meme

11:18.560 --> 11:22.320
Bashame's full name is Bashame Meme. I'm a first-year.

11:22.950 --> 11:26.870
Bashame admires you and really wanted to meet you

11:27.620 --> 11:33.140
and asked Sensei Ukai, she told you might be here.

11:33.520 --> 11:34.520
Hmph.

11:34.820 --> 11:39.770
So, you admired the clean, beautiful, and excellent student you saw at the ceremony

11:39.910 --> 11:42.500
and just had to meet me.

11:42.680 --> 11:45.460
Bashame want to be like you.

11:45.820 --> 11:49.760
So, so please take her as your apprentice.

11:50.000 --> 11:51.290
I'm sorry.

11:51.340 --> 11:52.790
I appreciate the sentiment, but…

11:52.810 --> 11:54.100
Shikanoko-senpai.

11:56.600 --> 11:58.600
Shikanoko-senpai?

11:59.130 --> 12:00.250
Huh?

12:00.420 --> 12:02.560
Shikanoko-san? Not me?

12:02.980 --> 12:04.680
Who are you?

12:04.720 --> 12:06.990
I just spoke at the entrance ceremony.

12:07.020 --> 12:08.670
I'm the student council president.

12:09.010 --> 12:13.240
Bashame wanted to meet Shikanoko-senpai and waited here.

12:13.430 --> 12:15.110
What's with this girl, is she sane?

12:15.510 --> 12:17.240
Why her, Bashame-san?

12:18.660 --> 12:20.280
You admire Shikanoko-san?

12:20.530 --> 12:22.400
Thank you for asking.

12:23.330 --> 12:25.410
That was before the entrance ceremony.

12:26.290 --> 12:29.800
When I was lying in front of the school gate.

12:29.860 --> 12:30.410
What?

12:31.430 --> 12:33.360
Hungry.

12:33.860 --> 12:36.220
Bashame is done for.

12:37.340 --> 12:40.810
Oh, the entrance ceremony is about to start.

12:41.020 --> 12:44.910
Bashame will die here without making a high school debut.

12:47.440 --> 12:48.270
Want something to eat?

12:55.670 --> 12:57.080
Thank you very much.

12:58.140 --> 12:58.770
Well then.

13:01.760 --> 13:03.340
Wait, please.

13:03.720 --> 13:06.000
Um, what's your name?

13:09.310 --> 13:11.620
It's not worth mentioning.

13:14.410 --> 13:20.340
So, Shikanoko-senpai is Bashame's lifesaver.

13:20.510 --> 13:22.810
A life saved by deer crackers?

13:23.120 --> 13:27.760
Since the entrance ceremony, Bashame kept thinking.

13:28.220 --> 13:30.750
What a cool senior.

13:30.990 --> 13:35.030
Bashame wants to be like that, to have that face.

13:35.300 --> 13:36.610
Want to become a deer?

13:36.760 --> 13:40.030
So, please make Bashame your disciple.

13:40.120 --> 13:42.190
Disciple, you say… Whoa!

13:42.380 --> 13:44.910
Why are butterflies swarming around you!

13:49.580 --> 13:51.570
Hey, what should we do about this one?

13:53.780 --> 13:55.880
You, the one called Bashame?

13:56.470 --> 13:58.010
Yes, I'm Bashame!

13:58.640 --> 14:01.820
Are you ready to become a deer?

14:01.990 --> 14:02.900
What's with that character!

14:02.930 --> 14:04.450
What's this "ready to become a deer" thing!?

14:04.740 --> 14:05.280
Yes!

14:05.440 --> 14:08.500
Bashame pledges to become a deer with all her might!

14:08.680 --> 14:09.840
What kind of teacher are you!?

14:10.150 --> 14:13.250
Then you must join the Deer Club first.

14:13.290 --> 14:14.260
Yes!

14:14.350 --> 14:16.010
Bashame will join the Deer Club!

14:16.140 --> 14:19.310
Don't advance the story without me!

14:19.990 --> 14:22.640
The Deer Club is led by Koshi-tan, who is also the caretaker.

14:22.910 --> 14:26.730
So first, ask Koshi-tan to take care of you.

14:27.280 --> 14:28.660
Understood! Okey-Dokey!

14:28.690 --> 14:30.590
Listen to the caretaker!

14:33.870 --> 14:35.340
Hey, what?

14:36.890 --> 14:38.630
I've graduated from middle school,

14:39.320 --> 14:42.470
and finally became a student at the same school as my sis.

14:43.130 --> 14:49.660
I've also applied to join the Deer Club. From now on, I'll be with my big sister 24/7?

14:50.010 --> 14:52.510
Deer Club

14:50.420 --> 14:52.910
Doing this and that as much as I want.

14:53.840 --> 14:54.900
Big sis!

14:56.640 --> 15:00.590
Koshi-tan-senpai, please take care of Bashame too.

15:01.010 --> 15:02.850
Hey, stop it!

15:04.610 --> 15:05.560
Sis?

15:05.640 --> 15:06.870
Ah, Anko!?

15:07.580 --> 15:10.460
What are you doing with another girl?

15:14.300 --> 15:14.940
Congratulations!

15:15.250 --> 15:17.570
Two new members have joined the Deer Club.

15:17.790 --> 15:20.790
Mt. Kinka seen from
Mt. Gobancho

15:23.480 --> 15:25.830
A lot happened, but now we have four members.

15:26.430 --> 15:28.250
The Deer Club is now a proper club!

15:28.720 --> 15:34.380
It used to be an obscure playgroup, but now we'll be very active!

15:31.930 --> 15:34.800
Deer Club

15:35.500 --> 15:36.150
Alright!

15:36.210 --> 15:38.750
You guys, let's get fired up from today!

15:38.980 --> 15:42.310
Position… Deer

15:38.980 --> 15:42.310
Shikanoko Noko
3rd Grade

15:42.400 --> 15:46.320
Position…
Self-proclaimed big sis caretaker

15:42.400 --> 15:46.320
Koshi Anko
1st Grade

15:42.570 --> 15:45.170
Matching mugs with my sister!

15:46.480 --> 15:50.320
Position…
More than human
and less than deer

15:46.480 --> 15:50.320
Bashame Meme
1st Grade

15:48.280 --> 15:49.390
Amazing!

15:53.450 --> 15:56.830
Position…
Manager and deer caretaker

15:53.450 --> 15:56.830
Koshi Torako
3rd Grade

15:54.100 --> 15:55.330
We can't go on like this!

15:57.260 --> 15:59.020
The Deer Club needs a makeover.

15:59.580 --> 16:00.710
 Deer Club Meeting

16:01.330 --> 16:06.210
So, the first Deer Club policy meeting begins!

16:06.500 --> 16:07.700
Something started.

16:08.090 --> 16:09.740
Her serious face is so cute!

16:10.900 --> 16:12.040
Be quiet!

16:12.190 --> 16:14.540
All you do is laze around!

16:14.680 --> 16:16.710
Don't you have any pride as a Deer Club member!?

16:16.820 --> 16:18.350
Pride of the Deer Club?

16:18.450 --> 16:20.150
Even if you say that…

16:20.520 --> 16:22.230
I'm sad.

16:22.540 --> 16:25.720
If others found out that the Deer Club is such a lazy club,

16:26.220 --> 16:28.690
which I worked hard to establish,

16:29.220 --> 16:34.540
my reputation will plummet and I'll be kicked from the student council!

16:35.930 --> 16:39.040
It's surprising that Koshi-tan-senpai was a delinquent,

16:39.230 --> 16:42.320
but her transparent personality is also amusing.

16:42.710 --> 16:45.100
That's cute too!

16:45.740 --> 16:46.710
We can't go on like this!

16:46.880 --> 16:49.400
Everyone, let's set our goals for this year!

16:49.560 --> 16:50.510
Okay!

16:50.670 --> 16:51.900
First, Shikanoko!

16:52.010 --> 16:52.980
Hm?

16:53.410 --> 16:59.310
As the representative of club and as a senior deer, tell your goals to the juniors!

16:59.740 --> 17:02.490
Well, let's see, I…

17:03.810 --> 17:05.780
want to take a bath in deer crackers!

17:06.000 --> 17:06.650
Nope!

17:06.940 --> 17:08.570
In the dining hall.

17:08.860 --> 17:11.130
Waste all funds om deer crackers?

17:11.370 --> 17:14.120
No, no, not like that, something more serious!

17:14.370 --> 17:17.150
Well, if not that…

17:17.860 --> 17:19.650
Hmm, nothing in particular.

17:19.800 --> 17:22.440
You're the one who created this club!

17:22.650 --> 17:23.960
Why did you create it!

17:24.540 --> 17:26.150
This one's no good.

17:26.460 --> 17:28.320
Can't set an example for the juniors.

17:29.030 --> 17:30.680
Next, apprentice deer Bashame!

17:36.420 --> 17:37.710
Don't cook rice in the club room!

17:38.190 --> 17:39.850
Koshi-tan-senpai, would you like some too?

17:40.030 --> 17:40.820
No, thanks!

17:41.090 --> 17:43.320
You said you wanted to become a deer, right?

17:43.580 --> 17:45.980
Don't you have something specific you want to do?

17:46.680 --> 17:49.030
Well, let's see…

17:50.750 --> 17:53.140
Bashame wants to make a rice field!

17:53.290 --> 17:54.090
What?

17:54.740 --> 17:55.870
A rice field?

17:56.140 --> 17:57.490
A vegetable garden would be fine too!

17:57.540 --> 17:58.820
I don't know…

17:59.460 --> 18:01.410
Bashame realized.

18:01.690 --> 18:08.860
To survive in this modern savannah as a deer, self-sufficiency is essential!

18:09.440 --> 18:12.710
So, I will make a rice field next to the club room!

18:13.010 --> 18:15.920
Bashame will grow rice as a deer!

18:16.000 --> 18:16.870
What does it mean to be a deer!

18:17.540 --> 18:19.090
Look forward to episode 10!

18:19.680 --> 18:24.080
Darn, they're all hopeless. The only one left is Anko! You're my only hope!

18:24.970 --> 18:26.330
Well…

18:27.000 --> 18:30.280
I joined the Deer Club to help my sister…

18:31.020 --> 18:34.800
So, I want to support my sister by her side.

18:35.670 --> 18:36.530
Anko!

18:36.620 --> 18:39.720
As expected of my sister! You're the only one I can count on!

18:40.040 --> 18:44.430
And ideally, I want my sister to be unable to live without me…

18:44.760 --> 18:45.650
Scary!

18:45.890 --> 18:48.700
Give me back the emotion from three seconds ago!

18:49.730 --> 18:52.060
So, what about you, Koshi-tan?

18:53.340 --> 18:56.460
Unlike you guys, I've thought it through!

18:56.750 --> 18:57.480
For example?

18:57.660 --> 19:00.210
There are many things, but to start with…

19:00.310 --> 19:01.240
To start with?

19:02.030 --> 19:03.920
I want to make the club room cuter!

19:06.850 --> 19:09.380
I think it's cute enough…

19:09.970 --> 19:15.770
No, this building was originally an old warehouse. We should rebuild it cuter…

19:15.850 --> 19:18.540
Koshi-tan's idea is the least relevant to the Deer Club!

19:18.770 --> 19:21.570
Is it okay for the student council president to mix public and private matters?

19:21.920 --> 19:23.680
That's called shelving your issues…

19:23.740 --> 19:27.260
Making the club room comfortable isn't a bad thing!

19:27.530 --> 19:31.850
It's the club president's duty to create a good environment for deer!

19:31.970 --> 19:35.130
Then the deer cracker bath will be allowed too.

19:35.230 --> 19:37.030
And Bashame's rice field…

19:37.270 --> 19:41.420
And my desire to do this and that with my sister in the club room…

19:41.500 --> 19:43.400
Anko, you're the only one who hasn't changed!

19:44.020 --> 19:46.130
First of all, Koshi-tan is wrong!

19:46.280 --> 19:48.830
The main purpose of the Deer Club is to take care of the deer!

19:49.340 --> 19:52.280
If you're the caretaker, you should take better care of me!

19:52.940 --> 19:55.760
If this continues, I'll leave the club!

19:55.920 --> 19:56.800
Huh?

19:57.050 --> 20:00.320
Then the Deer Club will have no deer…

20:00.540 --> 20:02.880
The Deer Club will be disbanded…

20:03.930 --> 20:08.570
Koshi-tan-senpai will be held responsible for disbanding the Deer Club.

20:08.690 --> 20:09.360
Wait!

20:10.170 --> 20:15.790
So, before discussing the Deer Club's activities, we demand better treatment for the deer!

20:13.540 --> 20:19.460
Take care of deer

20:16.010 --> 20:18.830
Ugh, she's throwing a bunch of valid points…

20:19.610 --> 20:22.800
Darn, so what should I do?

20:23.710 --> 20:24.790
Brushing.

20:25.230 --> 20:25.830
That's normal.

20:26.280 --> 20:26.690
Here.

20:28.220 --> 20:30.110
Alright, bring it on!

20:36.930 --> 20:38.140
I see.

20:38.280 --> 20:41.360
To become a better deer, brushing is essential!

20:41.480 --> 20:43.000
Bashame has learned!

20:43.060 --> 20:44.860
As expected of Nokotan-senpai!

20:46.480 --> 20:49.120
No, brushing has nothing to do with it.

20:49.220 --> 20:50.520
Koshi-tan-senpai!

20:50.720 --> 20:52.660
Bashame's head is open for brushing too.

20:54.290 --> 20:56.900
Bashame doesn't interested in you at all,

20:57.050 --> 21:03.060
but if you want to brush Bashame that much, Bashame wouldn't mind.

21:03.210 --> 21:04.680
Why are you acting superior!

21:04.870 --> 21:06.490
I didn't say that!

21:10.060 --> 21:12.290
Both of you, no, both deer.

21:14.030 --> 21:17.670
You don't understand anything about your caretaker sister.

21:17.960 --> 21:23.120
I've been with her for 15 years, longer than you two.

21:23.740 --> 21:25.160
So, in other words…

21:26.740 --> 21:30.280
I am the most suitable deer for the Deer Club!

21:30.470 --> 21:32.450
When did you become a deer!?

21:32.590 --> 21:34.630
Weren't you my caretaker!

21:35.220 --> 21:37.100
Hey, sister, what do you think?

21:37.380 --> 21:41.580
You'd rather brush me than those pests, right?

21:41.850 --> 21:42.600
Right?

21:42.730 --> 21:44.080
You're so intense!

21:44.420 --> 21:55.060
Deer Club

21:45.020 --> 21:48.280
In that case, let's have a contest to see who is the real deer!

21:48.460 --> 21:49.650
Bring it on!

21:49.720 --> 21:51.280
Bashame won't lose either!

21:51.350 --> 21:53.300
I said it's a meeting!

21:54.020 --> 21:55.260
I'm the deer!

21:55.950 --> 21:56.600
Deer!

21:57.000 --> 21:57.890
Deer!

22:00.690 --> 22:02.880
So this is the notorious Deer Club.

